- **Migration**: [`migrations/versions/893368a6f079_add_groq_api_key_and_preferred_model_to_.py`](file:///c:/Users/nofil/Desktop/Projects/Project/finance_app/migrations/versions/893368a6f079_add_groq_api_key_and_preferred_model_to_.py)
