### Model Integration
- **[`FinancialProfile`](file:///c:/Users/nofil/Desktop/Projects/Project/finance_app/app/models/financial_profile.py)**:
  - Added properties `has_custom_api_key` and `masked_api_key` (e.g. `gsk_••••••••yMWR`).
